{"page":{"id":"ec76366d-528a-47af-8ef3-b98f2002320d","theme":"world-of-warcraft","slug":"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance","title":"Alliance","meta_title":"Alliance (Warcraft) — organization, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Alliance unites humans, dwarves, gnomes, night elves, and later allies against the Horde and greater threats to Azeroth. Related pages: Azeroth,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Coalition of <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/eastern-kingdoms/stormwind\" class=\"entity-link\">Stormwind</a>, Ironforge, and allies.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Azeroth</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/eastern-kingdoms/stormwind\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Stormwind</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance/jaina-proudmoore\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Jaina Proudmoore</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Warcraft</strong></a>, <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance/night-elves\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Night Elves</strong></a> and <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Horde</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Alliance connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Located In:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a>\n            — The Alliance is based on <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/eastern-kingdoms/stormwind\" class=\"entity-link\">Stormwind</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/eastern-kingdoms/stormwind\" class=\"entity-link\">Stormwind</a> is a leading Alliance capital.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Has Member:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance/jaina-proudmoore\" class=\"entity-link\">Jaina Proudmoore</a>\n            — Jaina is a major Alliance figure.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft\" class=\"entity-link\">Warcraft</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft\" class=\"entity-link\">Warcraft</a> is connected to Alliance through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance/night-elves\" class=\"entity-link\">Night Elves</a>\n            — Alliance is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance/night-elves\" class=\"entity-link\">Night Elves</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a>\n            — Alliance is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/eastern-kingdoms/stormwind/anduin-wrynn\" class=\"entity-link\">Anduin Wrynn</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/eastern-kingdoms/stormwind/anduin-wrynn\" class=\"entity-link\">Anduin Wrynn</a> is connected to Alliance through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h